   "text": "Remove link S–E. Post-convergence path S → N → B →\nE → D, cost 2 + 3 + 1 + 2 = 8.",
   "originalText": "Remove link S–E. Post-convergence path S → N → B →\nE → D, cost 2 + 3 + 1 + 2 = 8.",
