   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The rule: remove the router, not the link",
   "originalText": "The rule: remove the router, not the link",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b19-text-15",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1098,
   "y": 166,
   "width": 441,
   "height": 113,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 118785,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1570935,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "link mode   remove link S–E\n  (b): dist(X,Y) < dist(X,S) + c(S,E) + dist(E,Y)\n\nnode mode   remove router E (all its links)\n  (b): dist(X,Y) < dist(X,E) + dist(E,Y)\n       (dist through E is ∞ if E is overloaded)",
   "originalText": "link mode   remove link S–E\n  (b): dist(X,Y) < dist(X,S) + c(S,E) + dist(E,Y)\n\nnode mode   remove router E (all its links)\n  (b): dist(X,Y) < dist(X,E) + dist(E,Y)\n       (dist through E is ∞ if E is overloaded)",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b19-text-16",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1098,
   "y": 289,
   "width": 524,
   "height": 192,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 126704,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1675664,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "•  Turned on by protection: node in the file (one\n   setting for the whole network, like Remote LFA in\n   A4).\n•  The rest of the walk is the same: furthest valid\n   Prefix-SID, else an Adj-SID (B15), clean-up (B16),\n   end with PrefixSID(D) (B17).\n•  E is not on the path, so it never ends a segment and\n   no Adj-SID names one of its links. (b) for E also\n   rules out the link S–E.",
   "originalText": "•  Turned on by protection: node in the file (one\n   setting for the whole network, like Remote LFA in\n   A4).\n•  The rest of the walk is the same: furthest valid\n   Prefix-SID, else an Adj-SID (B15), clean-up (B16),\n   end with PrefixSID(D) (B17).\n•  E is not on the path, so it never ends a segment and\n   no Adj-SID names one of its links. (b) for E also\n   rules out the link S–E.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
