   "text": "The walk in node mode, check by check (S → D)",
   "originalText": "The walk in node mode, check by check (S → D)",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b19-text-77",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 713,
   "width": 832,
   "height": 123,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 609763,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 8064133,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "From  Try      (a) dist = path cost?        (b) dist(X,Y) < dist(X,E) + dist(E,Y)   Result\n----  -------  ---------------------------  -------------------------------------   ---------------\nS     D, C, B  ✗  e.g. dist(S,B)=3, path 5                                           –\nS     N        ✓  2 = 2                     2 < 2 + 4  ✓                             P(N), dropped\nN     D        ✗  dist(N,D)=6, path 9                                                –\nN     C        ✓  6 = 6                     6 < 4 + 4  ✓                             P(C)\nC     D        ✓  3 = 3                     3 < 4 + 2  ✓                             P(D)",
   "originalText": "From  Try      (a) dist = path cost?        (b) dist(X,Y) < dist(X,E) + dist(E,Y)   Result\n----  -------  ---------------------------  -------------------------------------   ---------------\nS     D, C, B  ✗  e.g. dist(S,B)=3, path 5                                           –\nS     N        ✓  2 = 2                     2 < 2 + 4  ✓                             P(N), dropped\nN     D        ✗  dist(N,D)=6, path 9                                                –\nN     C        ✓  6 = 6                     6 < 4 + 4  ✓                             P(C)\nC     D        ✓  3 = 3                     3 < 4 + 2  ✓                             P(D)",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b19-text-78",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 846,
   "width": 986,
   "height": 40,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 617682,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 8168862,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "P = PrefixSID. dist() is the normal (pre-failure) distance: the other routers still use their old tables. P(N)\nonly reaches the first hop, so the clean-up drops it (B16). Result: [P(C), P(D)] = 16005, 16006.",
   "originalText": "P = PrefixSID. dist() is the normal (pre-failure) distance: the other routers still use their old tables. P(N)\nonly reaches the first hop, so the clean-up drops it (B16). Result: [P(C), P(D)] = 16005, 16006.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b19-rectangle-79",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 1080,
   "y": 657,
   "width": 560,
   "height": 247,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
   "backgroundColor": "#fff4e6",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   },
   "seed": 625601,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 8273591,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "b19-text-80",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1098,
   "y": 675,
   "width": 395,
   "height": 28,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 633520,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 8378320,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Can’t avoid E? Fall back to link",
   "originalText": "Can’t avoid E? Fall back to link",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b19-text-81",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1098,
   "y": 713,
   "width": 515,
   "height": 149,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 641439,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 8483049,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "•  D = E. S → E can’t avoid E. The engine installs the\n   link repair [P(B), P(E)] = 16004, 16002, marked\n   fallback: dest-is-next-hop.\n•  E is the only way to D. Example 10 in node mode, R3\n   → R5: R5 hangs off R4, so the repair is the link\n   one, fallback: none. RFC 9855 has no rule here;\n   falling back still covers the link failure (D51).",
   "originalText": "•  D = E. S → E can’t avoid E. The engine installs the\n   link repair [P(B), P(E)] = 16004, 16002, marked\n   fallback: dest-is-next-hop.\n•  E is the only way to D. Example 10 in node mode, R3\n   → R5: R5 hangs off R4, so the repair is the link\n   one, fallback: none. RFC 9855 has no rule here;\n   falling back still covers the link failure (D51).",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b19-rectangle-82",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 924,
   "width": 533,
   "height": 202,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#7048e8",
   "backgroundColor": "#f3f0ff",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
