  {
   "id": "b19-text-90",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1125,
   "y": 980,
   "width": 486,
   "height": 128,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 712710,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 9425610,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "•  Same idea for LFA (B5) and Remote LFA (B12): the\n   backup must avoid router E.\n•  Router failure simulation (A9) shows what really\n   happens when E dies.\n•  With SRLGs the engine falls back one step at a\n   time (A19).",
   "originalText": "•  Same idea for LFA (B5) and Remote LFA (B12): the\n   backup must avoid router E.\n•  Router failure simulation (A9) shows what really\n   happens when E dies.\n•  With SRLGs the engine falls back one step at a\n   time (A19).",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
